      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Lampejo. Sempre que estende ou contrai os músculos, Shinx gera eletricidade. Seu corpo brilha quando ele está em perigo, e sua pelagem ajuda a acumular essa energia.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/4 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Shinx pode evoluir para Luxio no nível 5 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Leer, Thunder Shock</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Charge</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Baby-Doll Eyes</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Spark</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Bite</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Roar</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Volt Switch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Swagger</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Thunder Fang</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Crunch, Thunder Wave</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Scary Face</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Discharge</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Wild Charge</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Attract, Baby-Doll Eyes, Charge, Charge Beam, Confide, Confuse Ray, Crunch, Double Team, Double-Edge, Eerie Impulse, Electric Terrain, Electro Ball, Electroweb, Endure, Facade, Fake Tears, Fire Fang, Frustration, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Ice Fang, Iron Tail, Light Screen, Magnet Rise, Play Rough, Protect, Psychic Fangs, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Rising Voltage, Roar, Round, Scary Face, Shock Wave, Signal Beam, Sleep Talk, Snarl, Snore, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Take Down, Tera Blast, Thief, Thunder, Thunder Fang, Thunder Wave, Thunderbolt, Toxic, Trailblaze, Volt Switch, Wild Charge</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Baby-Doll Eyes, Double Kick, Eerie Impulse, Fake Tears, Fire Fang, Helping Hand, Howl, Ice Fang, Night Slash, Quick Attack, Shock Wave, Signal Beam, Swift, Take Down, Thunder Fang</p>",
